{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55613","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"触目堪嗟失路人，坦然王道却迷津。\n井藤梗上存余命，石火光中保幻身。\n任老岂知头顶白，忘缘谁觉世间春？\n容颜枯槁元非病。\n亭沼消疏不是贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}